        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Right lower leg redness"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient noticed a small red patch on the right shin yesterday morning, initially thought to be an insect bite. Today redness had increased and felt to have spread a little down and around the side over approximately 24–36 hours. Examination: poorly demarcated erythema over the anterior shin, approximately 12 cm craniocaudal by approximately 8 cm circumferentially."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
